# DrumMania 10th Mix: the network PCB unit's data installer (--cd hdd, d40jca02), from what
# drmn10m-boot left. The game finds the unit's disk unformatted, formats it and copies the
# e-AMUSEMENT song data to it (DATA INSTALLATION MODE); 9000 frames is about 13 %, the whole
# install about 69000. The disk is the save folder's npu_hdd/ (runtime/sys573/npu.h).
# Beyond MAME, which has no network unit.
game drmn10m

from 0 every 600 snap
at 9000 quit
